{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226200","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1222620001:0":{"text":"ついに捕まえたぞ。今までどこに隠れていた？他に仲間はいるのか？","source_cn":"终于逮到你了！你之前藏在哪？还有没有其他同党！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x091855871E759705","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222620002:0":{"text":"……さあね。","source_cn":"……无可奉告。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7CC9C24FB8582AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222620003:0":{"text":"お前が何を探しているのかは知っている。言え、バンティスの法具をどこに隠した？","source_cn":"我们知道你在找什么。说，霍德希金让你把班题斯圣器藏在哪里了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4D3FFB3B68CFCC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222620004:0":{"text":"なっ……！？いえ、法具がどこにあるかなんて知らないわ。","source_cn":"你们怎么……？！不，我不知道圣器在哪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDAF3F0D677CE5B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1222620004":{"text":"なっ……！？いえ、法具がどこにあるかなんて知らないわ。","source_cn":"你们怎么……？！不，我不知道圣器在哪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDAF3F0D677CE5B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222620005:0":{"text":"法具が海に沈んだことは周知の事実です。でもあなたは「どこにあるか知らない」と言いました。","source_cn":"波妮，圣器沉入海底是大家公认的事实，你却没这么说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x586E0846263FEE11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222620006:0":{"text":"つまり、法具は海ではないどこか別の場所にあるのでしょう？","source_cn":"所以，你其实知道它另有下落吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x203390E6D03CA061","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222620007:0":{"text":"ふん……あなたのペットは、少し想像力が乏しいようね、メイジ様。","source_cn":"哼……大魔法师，你养的小老鼠还是太缺乏想象力了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x77C0EABF2C07ED05","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ふん……あなたのペットは、少し想像力が乏しいようね、メイジ様。","female":"ふん……あなたのペットは、少し想像力が乏しいようね、メイジ様。","variant_male_record_index":"137477","variant_female_record_index":"137478","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222620008:0":{"text":"痛い目を見ないと分からないようだな。いいか、ブラッディ・マリーはグレイヴボーンに容赦はしない！","source_cn":"看来得吃点苦头才愿意开口。告诉你，血薇帮不会对亡灵手软！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35510E575F4CB86B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222620009:0":{"text":"愚かね、法具が認めた持ち主は、我らが偉大なる死海の艦隊の船長、ホジキン様ただ一人よ！","source_cn":"蠢货，圣器只认可它的主人——死潮舰队的伟大船长，霍德希金！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05824C1AFEE1B2ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222620010:0":{"text":"あなたたちなんかに、法具を御せるわけがないでしょう。","source_cn":"单凭你们也妄图号令它？不要做梦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x794199E141CAA8B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222620011:0":{"text":"その死海の艦隊は、今や海底の奥底に沈んだ。","source_cn":"死潮舰队都已经和海底的礁石为伴了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BBA42A730FDD4DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222620012:0":{"text":"お前の船長とやらも、今頃喉に詰まった海草を掻き出すのに忙しいんじゃないか？","source_cn":"至于你的狗屁船长，就算他死不了，估计这会儿也在忙着抠出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3340EE4736AEE06D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222620013:0":{"text":"大口をたたけるのも今のうちよ。","source_cn":"珍惜现在吧，你还能嚣张地放肆言语。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x776CF9010F40312D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222620014:0":{"text":"黒き帆が再び風を捉えし時、嵐が再びあなたたちの顔を恐怖で歪ませるわ！","source_cn":"当黑帆在海面上扬起，风浪会将恐惧重新推回到你们脸上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9FA4F60B3C5760A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1222620015:0":{"text":"この野郎！","source_cn":"——你这混蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14DB521CAC4441BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1222620015":{"text":"この野郎！","source_cn":"——你这混蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14DB521CAC4441BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222620016:0":{"text":"ルカさん！怒りで我を忘れてはダメです！いったんどこかで話し合いましょう。","source_cn":"卢卡，你被愤怒冲昏头了，我们先找个地方慢慢商议吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x636A4EAABC531B25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222620017:0":{"text":"はい！ロンロンが見張ってます！怪我をしてますし、そう簡単には逃げられないはずです。","source_cn":"嗯，她受了伤，一时片刻逃不掉。满满会看住她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8FD6354965F0035","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222620018:0":{"text":"ふん……卑怯なネズミどもめ。","source_cn":"哼……卑鄙的老鼠们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F188E2CF9F07BEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:29:1222620019:0":{"text":"怪我したボニーをロンロンに任せ、あなたたちは彼女から聞こえない場所へ移動した――","source_cn":"控制住波妮后，大家走到不会被她监听的地方进行交谈——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27CE231D416F6007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1222620020:0":{"text":"本当に口の硬い副船長さんですね……","source_cn":"唉，这位大副嘴真的很硬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49B45B0CE0677877","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1222620021:0":{"text":"奴と無駄話する必要はない。ブラッディ・マリーのやり方で口を割らせてやる！","source_cn":"不用和她废话。让她见识见识血薇帮的特殊手段！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5F9A5F3509388F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1222620022:0":{"text":"待ってください。グレイヴボーンの意志はとても強いんです。死海の艦隊に心から忠誠を誓っている彼女に暴力は効果がないかも……","source_cn":"不过，亡灵的意志力很顽强，她又对死潮舰队忠心耿耿，暴力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2A8E1C6F5910750","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1222620023:0":{"text":"このままここで我慢比べするか、もしくは……","source_cn":"要在这里跟她耗着吗？还是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x574E7753BAB8098B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:35:1222620023":{"text":"このままここで我慢比べするか、もしくは……","source_cn":"要在这里跟她耗着吗？还是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x574E7753BAB8098B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_ind